        "Description": "Two assassins have been employed to assassinate Carl Ingram during the Burj All-Ghazali opening ceremony. As Ingram&apos;s bodyguard, you must exterminate all threats. Your first target is Roberto Francullita, Ingram&apos;s personal chef who plans on spiking his meal with a lethal dose of poison. You must find him, and remove him from the kitchen by any means neccessary. Your next target, Zana Kazemi, is a famous assassin with a meeting planned with Carl Ingram.",
